nd emotions.\n\nTags: TTS/架构-AR-LLM, TTS/架构-NAR-Flow, TTS/控制-参考语音, TTS/控制-指令合成, TTS/功能-RL优化, TTS/功能-多语言, TTS/功能-方言小语种, TTS/功能-多说话人, 压缩/监督-有监督, 压缩/语义声学-混合\n===CosyVoice3===","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-aa5b53e0ffe1871c","type":"tool_result","content":"# MegaTTS 3: Sparse Alignment Enhanced Latent Diffusion Transformer for Zero-Shot Speech Synthesis\narXiv: 2502.18924\nAuthors: Ziyue Jiang, Yi Ren, Ruiqi Li, Shengpeng Ji, Boyang Zhang, Zhenhui Ye, Chen Zhang, Bai Jionghao, Xiaoda Yang, Jialong Zuo, Yu Zhang, Rui Liu, Xiang Yin, Zhou Zhao\nYear: 2025 | Venue: \nTopic: tts_vc\nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. We design a sparse alignment enhanced latent diffusion transformer model that effectively integrates the strengths of implicit and predefined speech-text alignment approaches while demonstrating greater robustness to duration prediction errors.\n  2. We propose a multi-condition classifier-free guidance strategy to separately adjust guidance scales for speaker timbre and text content, enabling flexible control over accent intensity.\n  3. We successfully reduce the inference steps from 25 to 8 using the piecewise rectified flow technique, achieving highly efficient zero-shot text-to-speech synthesis with minimal quality degradation.\n\nTags: TTS, TTS/架构-NAR-Diffusion, TTS/功能-DiT, TTS/控制-参考语音, TTS/功能-蒸馏加速\n===MegaTTS3===\n# Spark-TTS: An Efficient LLM-Based Text-to-Speech Model with Single-Stream Decoupled Speech Tokens\narXiv: 2503.01710\nAuthors: Xinsheng Wang, Mingqi Jiang, Ziyang Ma, Ziyu Zhang, Songxiang Liu, Linqin Li, Zheng Liang, Qixi Zheng, Rui Wang, Xiaoqin Feng, Weizhen Bian, Zhen Ye, Sitong Cheng, Ruibin Yuan, Zhixian Zhao, Xinfa Zhu, Jiahao Pan, Liumeng Xue, Pengcheng Zhu, Yunlin Chen, Zhifei Li, Xie Chen, Lei Xie, Yike Guo, Wei Xue\nYear: 2025 | Venue: \nTopic: tts_vc\nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. We present BiCodec, a unified speech tokenization that generates a hybrid token stream combining semantic and global tokens to maintain linguistic fidelity while enabling attribute control.\n  2. Spark-TTS implements a comprehensive attribute control system tha