en Bian, Zhen Ye, Sitong Cheng, Ruibin Yuan, Zhixian Zhao, Xinfa Zhu, Jiahao Pan, Liumeng Xue, Pengcheng Zhu, Yunlin Chen, Zhifei Li, Xie Chen, Lei Xie, Yike Guo, Wei Xue\nYear: 2025 | Venue: \nTopic: tts_vc\nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. We present BiCodec, a unified speech tokenization that generates a hybrid token stream combining semantic and global tokens to maintain linguistic fidelity while enabling attribute control.\n  2. Spark-TTS implements a comprehensive attribute control system that seamlessly integrates both coarse-grained and fine-grained voice parameters within a text LLM-compatible architecture.\n  3. We introduce VoxBox, a rigorously curated 100,000-hour speech corpus with comprehensive attribute annotations to establish a standardized benchmark for TTS research.\n\nTags: TTS, 压缩, TTS/架构-AR-LLM, 压缩/量化-VQ, 压缩/量化-FSQ, 压缩/语义声学-语义, TTS/控制-参考语音\n===SparkTTS===\nPaper 2606.11611 not found\n===SARA===","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
